{"id":"chatcmpl-fae05a39-b9c4-46b8-8ae2-a4198c8584a6","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245283,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a dual-verification strategy for spatial/visual medical image interpretation: query a domain-specific expert tool for a targeted description, then independently confirm with a grounded localization tool. Agreement between two independent sources justifies the final answer. The pattern generalizes to any binary spatial finding where direction/side must be determined.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a question asks to distinguish between two directional/lateral options, first query a domain expert tool with a targeted question that explicitly asks for the direction (e.g., 'does it curve toward the patient's right or left?').\",\n    \"Independently verify the spatial finding using a second, differently-implemented tool (e.g., grounded localization/report) to cross-check the side or direction before committing to an answer.\",\n    \"Convert the raw visual description into the option's terminology by mapping the observed direction (convexity/side) to the corresponding labeled choice.\",\n    \"Only finalize when both independent sources agree; if they conflict, treat the disagreement as a signal to re-examine rather than guessing.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Use a specialized expert tool for a focused descriptive question, then confirm with a grounded localization tool; require agreement before answering.\",\n    \"Binary spatial/directional classification\": \"Phrase the expert query to explicitly elicit the direction (left/right, up/down), then map the described direction to the matching option label.\",\n    \"Cross-validation of tool outputs\": \"Prefer answers supported by two independent tools with different mechanisms; treat single-source answers as lower confidence.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the expert tool's described direction (e.g., convexity side) matches the chosen option's wording exactly.\",\n    \"Verify the second tool's localization independently supports the same side/direction before finalizing.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":434,"total_tokens":825,"completion_tokens":391,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":434},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":391}}}